# scripts/conformance_suites.cxd — the register of scripts/conformance_suites.cx
# (cx-private#1840; RULED: STREAM-1).
#
# [suite name=… cases=… pass=…] records each corpus's run: a run that differs
# is refused until the row is updated (`--record` prints the rows), so a pass
# count never moves unseen. JSONTestSuite's i_ files are implementation-
# defined; i-accepted= records how many of them this build accepts.
#
# [known suite=… case=… why=…] names a case that does not pass and who owns
# it — exactly one of:
#   issue=     an open issue (the fix lands there; the row goes when it passes)
#   ruled=     a spec sentence declines the construct
#   upstream=  the corpus itself is wrong
# A failure with no row, or a row whose case passes, is refused.
#
# The corpora: third_party/suites/README.md.

[conformance-suites
  [suite name=json cases=283 pass=281 i-accepted=7]
